msgid "requires the WooCommerce PDF Invoices & Packing Slips plugin (WP Overnight) to be active."
msgstr "requiere el plugin WooCommerce PDF Invoices & Packing Slips (WP Overnight) activo."

msgid "requires WooCommerce PDF Invoices & Packing Slips version 4.0 or higher."
msgstr "requiere WooCommerce PDF Invoices & Packing Slips versión 4.0 o superior."

